# PROJECT: A CUTE, CINEMATIC, INTERACTIVE BIRTHDAY EXPERIENCE

Act as a world-class creative frontend developer, motion designer, UI/UX designer, and interactive storytelling engineer.

Build a complete, fully functional, highly polished, interactive birthday surprise website for a special girl.

This is NOT a generic birthday website, a static portfolio, or a collection of cards. It is a personalised, cinematic, multi-scene birthday adventure where the user explores a sequence of adorable, funny, emotional, and memorable experiences.

The entire website must have a consistent, dreamy pink aesthetic with cute cat characters, soft lighting, pastel colours, playful typography, beautiful animations, and exceptionally smooth transitions.

The experience should feel handcrafted, personal, magical, and delightful.

Do not stop at designing a mockup. IMPLEMENT THE ACTUAL WEBSITE, INCLUDING ALL INTERACTIONS, ANIMATIONS, SCENE TRANSITIONS, BUTTONS, IMAGE PLACEHOLDERS, AND MUSIC CONTROLS.

Do not ask me questions. Make sensible creative decisions wherever details are missing, while preserving every requirement below.

